{"id":"n42306-1-6","stage":4,"title":"자취 · 痕迹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42306-1-6-1","ko":"고향에도 우리가 놀던 옛날의 자취는 찾아보기 힘들군.","zh":"在老家也很难找到我们以前常去玩的那些地方了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고향에도","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향에도","audio":"/audio/f0d4b457635728230b97.mp3"}},{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"놀던","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀던","audio":"/audio/36a0a15a9e70b0a154d8.mp3"}},{"text":"옛날의","meaning":"过去，昔日","explanation":"옛날：过去，昔日；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"옛날","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57273","senseId":"2","lemma":"옛날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옛날의","audio":"/audio/6dbe338c9aa6c26a12d5.mp3"}},{"text":"자취는","meaning":"痕迹，踪迹，踪影","explanation":"자취：痕迹，踪迹，踪影；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자취","audio":"/audio/4dd078feb85e3f70a155.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42306","senseId":"1","lemma":"자취","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자취는","audio":"/audio/d3845775aa9b80403960.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아보기","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아보기","audio":"/audio/c536d125279ec5b38acf.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들군.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들군","audio":"/audio/50f059a0e3db87aa58a1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"336963582ab921f0","term":"옛날","zh":"过去，昔日","audio":"/audio/336963582ab921f0c295.mp3","entryId":"57273","definition":"以前的某一时段。","pronunciation":["옌ː날"]},{"id":"4dd078feb85e3f70","term":"자취","zh":"痕迹，踪迹，踪影","audio":"/audio/4dd078feb85e3f70a155.mp3","entryId":"42306","definition":"某物留下的标记或形迹。","pronunciation":["자취"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a4da9cbed1519fdf63d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42306-1-6-2","ko":"그럼, 세월이 벌써 얼마나 흘렀는데.","zh":"是啊，时间已经过去这么久了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼,","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"세월이","meaning":"岁月，光阴，年华，时光","explanation":"세월：岁月，光阴，年华，时光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"세월","audio":"/audio/54d9aa79a74486473c4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49225","senseId":"1","lemma":"세월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세월이","audio":"/audio/d87545d88cbe74339d7a.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"흘렀는데.","meaning":"流，流淌，流逝","explanation":"흐르다：流，流淌，流逝；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"흐르다","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29757","senseId":"2","lemma":"흐르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘렀는데","audio":"/audio/302b287d3b6b6dfd766f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"54d9aa79a7448647","term":"세월","zh":"岁月，光阴，年华，时光","audio":"/audio/54d9aa79a74486473c4b.mp3","entryId":"49225","definition":"流逝的时间。","pronunciation":["세ː월"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나",